		<main>
			<section id="about" style="padding: 4rem 0; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a, #2a2a2a);">
				<div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem;">
					<h2 style="text-align: center; font-family: 'Orbitron', monospace; font-size: 3rem; color: var(--rainbow-pink); margin-bottom: 3rem; text-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--rainbow-pink);">
						ABOUT ESBEN
					</h2>
					
					<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 3rem; margin-top: 3rem;">
						<div style="background: rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.1); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 15px; border: 2px solid var(--rainbow-pink);">
							<h3 style="color: var(--rainbow-pink); font-family: 'Orbitron', monospace; margin-bottom: 1rem;">🚀 Full-Stack Developer (BUSSIN!)</h3>
							<p>Building web applications that are as smooth as my head. From frontend to backend, I make it all work seamlessly. HIGHKEY giving that DRIP! 💯</p>
						</div>
						
						<div style="background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 15px; border: 2px solid var(--rainbow-blue);">
							<h3 style="color: var(--rainbow-blue); font-family: 'Orbitron', monospace; margin-bottom: 1rem;">🎯 Problem Solver (NO CAP!)</h3>
							<p>Debugging is my superpower! I find bugs faster than you can say "it works on my machine." This hits DIFFERENT! 🧠</p>
						</div>
						
						<div style="background: rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.1); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 15px; border: 2px solid var(--rainbow-green);">
							<h3 style="color: var(--rainbow-green); font-family: 'Orbitron', monospace; margin-bottom: 1rem;">💡 Innovation Enthusiast (LIT AF!)</h3>
							<p>Always exploring new technologies and pushing the boundaries of what's possible in software development. FAM, this is the way! ⚡</p>
						</div>
